  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Narc is a 1-2 player game, where your mission is to infiltrate the Mr. Big Corporation, the scourge of the underworld. To do this, you must get through the game's eight stages, with over ten sectors like the junkyard, subway, drug lab, nursery, downtown, Sunset Strip, and even the corporation, where Mr. Big resides. In order to get through the stages, you are required to collect a number of safe cards, and insert them in the slot next to the stage exit.  Each sector includes a map, and should be easy to read. For example, the blue or red dots represent you, and the white dots are the missile launchers, while the &quot;E&quot; indicates the exit.\n\nYour mission ain't going to be easy, as you will come face-to-face with enemies including the canine mutts, Das Lof Gang, Dr. Spike Rush, Joe Rockhead, Kinky Pinky, Sgt. Skyhigh, HQ Posse, and Mr. Big himself. You have two ways you can deal with them: either put a bullet in them or make arrests. Furthermore, they will try to blow you up the minute they see you. Fortunately, you're armed with a shotgun and missile launcher, but these both have a limited supply of ammunition. If your bullet counter reaches one, you can only fire one bullet at a time, so you need to find some more. Also, it is important not to waste all of your missiles: you might need them later when you deal with later enemies like Mr. Big. You are also backed up by a chopper and a mean shiny street machine.\n\nMore often than not, when you blow up enemies, you can pick up several items that they drop, including drugs, money, ammunition, missile launchers, and if you're lucky, safe cards.  Even if you got the safe card and can pass the level, you can keep blowing up enemies to score more points. According to the game, this game is for training purposes only, so you will not get employed by your local DEA office. Is this what the DEA does every day: go on rampages?"
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "NARC sur NES est un jeu d'action mettant en scène les viriles aventures de deux flics plutôt copains luttant contre les narcotrafiquants. Vous devrez traverser 8 niveaux remplis d'action avant d'arriver jusqu'à la tête de l'organisation de malfrats."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Narc ist ein Spiel für 1-2 Spieler, in dem deine Aufgabe darin besteht, die Mr. Big Corporation, die Geißel der Unterwelt, zu infiltrieren. Dazu musst du die acht Level des Spiels mit über zehn Sektoren bewältigen. Um durch die Abschnitte zu gelangen, musst du eine Reihe von Safe-Karten sammeln und sie in den Schlitz neben dem Ausgang des jeweiligen Abschnitts stecken. Für jeden Sektor wird dir eine Karte angezeigt, die leicht zu lesen sein sollte. Die blauen oder roten Punkte stehen zum Beispiel für dich, die weißen Punkte für die Raketenwerfer und das &quot;E&quot; für den Ausgang."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Controlas a Max Force o Hit Man, agentes antidrogas en una misión para destruir la corporación criminal de Mr. Big. Enfrentas enemigos como Kinky Pinky y Sgt. Skyhigh, usando armas y arrestos. Recolectas tarjetas de seguridad para avanzar por sectores como el laboratorio, el metro y el Sunset Strip. Violento, frenético y con un mensaje directo: justicia sin piedad."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Narc è un gioco per 1-2 giocatori, in cui la tua missione è infiltrarti nella Mr. Big Corporation, il flagello degli inferi. Per fare ciò, devi superare le otto fasi del gioco, con oltre dieci settori come la discarica, la metropolitana, il laboratorio di droga, l'asilo nido, il centro, Sunset Strip e persino la società, dove risiede Mr. Big. Per superare le fasi, è necessario raccogliere un certo numero di carte sicure e inserirle nello slot accanto all'uscita della fase. Ogni settore include una mappa e dovrebbe essere di facile lettura. Ad esempio, i punti blu o rossi rappresentano te e i punti bianchi sono i lanciamissili, mentre la &quot;E&quot; indica l'uscita."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Narc é um jogo para 1-2 jogadores, onde sua missão é se infiltrar na Mr. Big Corporation, o flagelo do submundo. Para fazer isso, você deve passar pelas oito etapas do jogo, com mais de dez setores, como ferro-velho, metrô, laboratório de drogas, creche, centro da cidade, Sunset Strip e até a corporação, onde Big reside. Para passar pelos estágios, é necessário coletar vários cartões seguros e inseri-los no slot ao lado da saída do estágio. Cada setor inclui um mapa e deve ser fácil de ler. Por exemplo, os pontos azuis ou vermelhos representam você, e os pontos brancos são os lançadores de mísseis, enquanto o &quot;E&quot; indica a saída."
    }
  ],
